\cf0 2000\'962006/07
\f0\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Croatia, Yugoslavia and Maldives were added later; Kosovo was subsequently covered; the 2004 enlargement removed new EU members; Russia and Ukraine were activated under a separate conditional mandate, while Moldova and Belarus were not. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32000D0024&utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 EUR-Lex}}\cell \row

