\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth14353\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 2007\'96June 2014
\f0\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The original decision mixed actually eligible and merely potential countries. Central Asia was activated in November 2008; the 2011 decision substantially recast the actual list; Syria was first politically frozen and then formally removed; Croatia ceased to be external upon EU accession. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?qid=1771220049908&uri=CELEX%3A32006D1016&utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 EUR-Lex}}\cell \row

