\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Treat EU accession, state succession and entities such as Kosovo, Palestine and Macao explicitly rather than relying only on ISO membership.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Most importantly, if your dependent variable contains 
\f1\b all EIB commitments
\f0\b0 , the ELM alone is not the complete eligibility universe. ACP/Cotonou lending, OCT operations, pre-accession instruments and some own-risk facilities operated under other legal bases. Either filter commitments to ELM/EFSD+-backed operations or construct separate instrument-specific eligibility variables. Otherwise you will code some genuine EIB commitments as occurring in \'93ineligible\'94 countries.\
